> 
> Introduce an append-only event log plus workers.
> 
> ```text
> Chat/API/UI
>     │
>     ▼
> Task creation ──► Policy/planner ──► Workflow DAG
>     │                                      │
>     ▼                                      ▼
> Event log ◄──────── operation workers / tool adapters
