> 
> Caller contract:
> - responders.py calls `adapter.allowed(estimated_prompt_tokens)` before
>   invocation;
> - responders.py calls chat_response/stream_response only after Planner's
>   context assembler has created effective messages;
> - metrics.py records actual provider usage where available;
> - no adapter should rely on a global mutable "last responder".
